{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_title", "source_sha256": "2b158aae359ae2f49923fc70b83d879cada9cc2a71704eac2190f22967e85896", "ja": "忍ばずに　真心魅せます　花咲夜", "zh": "不隐忍　展现真心　花咲夜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2c5a9a849a317c89de62201469a833165c537ade96cae50d8966196a2e7c1b82", "ja": "ドラマ『くノ一お凛』のDVD特典を収録中\nの『花咲夜』。はしゃぎ過ぎたかも、と反省\nするエミリーを、好きな気持ちを伝える事は\n大切、と励ます紬と朋花。3人は一層気合い\nを入れて撮影に臨むのだった。", "zh": "正在录制电视剧《くノ一お凛》的DVD特典内容，  \n《花咲夜》的成员们。紬和朋花鼓励着反省自己  \n是不是太兴奋过头了的艾米莉，告诉她传达自己  \n喜欢的心情是很重要的。3人也更加打起精神，投入拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1000_032emi", "source_sha256": "4f5cedee469823a62d64955810fbd9bbc606ad96cd33eb2e9949127eacd7c1a8", "ja": "みなさま、こんにちは！　私たちは今、忍者活劇\n『必中！　くノ一お凛』の撮影現場に来ています！", "zh": "各位观众，大家好！我们现在来到了忍者活剧\n《必中！女忍者凛》的拍摄现场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5ad106dfe89ec206e2603fa8129f213990692373c9fe198631181aa5a69f8773", "ja": "こちらのDVD特典では、ドラマの撮影場所や実際に\n使われた小道具などをご紹介していこうと思います。", "zh": "在本DVD特典中，我们将为大家介绍电视剧的拍摄地点，以及实际使用过的道具等。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "cd22df32b80cc7db9272a485a93e38cb7dcc3cbfa1c6b615ad0b19a227de3a72", "ja": "それに……なんと！　撮影時の裏話もあるんです♪\nご存じでしたか？　お凛様はなんと……！", "zh": "而且……还有拍摄时的幕后趣闻哦♪\n您知道吗？凛大人她竟然……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "00dfaf59386f98d13aa00f838961b1bc1f659ffb4cfbc72ed470d790b2a66a7b", "ja": "うふふ、エミリーちゃん、そこまでにしましょうね～。\nそこから先は、この後のお楽しみですよ～。", "zh": "呵呵，艾米莉，就先说到这里吧～。\n再往下说的话，可就要留到之后再期待啰～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "9b9cc961c10fb600cca2adc79e4e7140ac35f5c92a5fc683d1578a4d548c9ee3", "ja": "はっ！　す、すみません！\n私、つい興奮してしまって……。", "zh": "啊！对、对不起！我一不小心就激动起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4646b3b2b96448971b5cfb35008465c79ffe5b6c54d651058d5e8869851162b8", "ja": "ふふ、このように、今日は『くノ一お凛』が大好きな\nエミリーさんと私たちがドラマの魅力をお伝えします。", "zh": "呵呵，今天就由最喜欢《女忍者阿凛》的艾米莉小姐和我们，一起为大家介绍这部电视剧的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "bd3cfe039d6e51d8f18b92612beb1345b97245203dc6166792b1ba60a71b19e6", "ja": "ここでしか見られない内容も沢山ありますからね～。\n最後まで、心して見てくださいね～。", "zh": "因为有很多只有在这里才能看到的内容哦～\n请做好心理准备，看到最后吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1007_satsueisutaffu", "source_sha256": "35643c59847f3fa57126c17f239d2e7c3a93ee08240c27079862365797ab2861", "ja": "……カーット！　はい、今のでいただきまーす！\n次のシーンまで、一旦休憩で！", "zh": "……咔！好，刚才那条过了——！\n到下一场戏之前，先休息一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f380d3f9da70d9b8be47a4dfcb68052c50a9c36910e4fc58bb044704ed89f878", "ja": "ふぅ……おふたりとも、お疲れさまです。\n撮影、いい調子ですね。", "zh": "呼……两位都辛苦了。\n拍摄进展得很顺利呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "62ccc6f93de3a32d0d2f33859a2d5b805d11ed46a222210fb6db0636ba87c6b4", "ja": "ええ、悪くない滑り出しだと思います～。\nエミリーちゃんも、見事なトークでしたよ～♪", "zh": "嗯，我觉得开场不错呢～  \n艾米莉，刚才的谈话也很精彩哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "22dcd838d57f28134a81b807dffaccae24bdc642ce9ee1260f7646424702f2ee", "ja": "……。\nエミリーちゃん？　どうかしましたか～？", "zh": "……  \n艾米莉？怎么了～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "90799608293a653cd1b3e9062f744c1b5f1a4c163321131e77164efd85ab3f33", "ja": "……。あっ！？　は、はい、すみません！\nちょっとぼんやりしてしまって……！", "zh": "……。啊！？是、是的，非常抱歉！\n我稍微走神了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "98ca3ea286c2c643eab19b9c03ec5c1b67efd28f625566c4f2849910ac502f0c", "ja": "エミリーさん、浮かない顔をしていますが、\n何か悩んでいるのですか？", "zh": "艾米莉，你看起来闷闷不乐的，是有什么烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "920cca279126421a105331ab5697c6d9f203a0aa18fc1b2f1ee29f5cce79dafb", "ja": "紬さん、そ、それは……。\n私、ついはしゃぎすぎてしまいましたので……。", "zh": "紬小姐，那、那个……我刚才一不小心太兴奋了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "3d9331ddb5922ffd760751fd3ce9b13cdb9bad6e1938ae1335a1e5ea2d1ce48b", "ja": "うっかり、喋りすぎてしまって。\n朋花さんが止めてくださらなかったら……うう。", "zh": "不小心说得太多了。\n要是朋花小姐没有阻止我的话……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "2c1076ab0ac089ceead61e54f9499b8e20a00501bcc1b85e3865c4d3b817e1d9", "ja": "大和撫子らしく、落ち着いていなければいけないのに。\n私、まだまだ未熟者です……。", "zh": "本应像大和抚子那样沉着冷静才对。\n我果然还是太不成熟了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "744f176cdf2f5f86bb1c0014295862ce1b98c37e93853239adf3b9efd22a16e2", "ja": "いえ、とてもかわいらしかったですよ～。\nね、紬さん。", "zh": "不，非常可爱哦～  \n对吧，紬小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "43b4b6327831b5fcd69ae7a8da39bd442e9689918315783bf610f4292799f0e2", "ja": "はい。それに……とても、心強かったです。\nたくさん喋ってくださるので、進めやすかったですよ。", "zh": "是的。而且……真的让我觉得很可靠。\n因为您说了很多话，我也更容易推进下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "3a7fd428cb5b8a44fff179aa6433209e0630c4f9e3df79764325366aef6e9908", "ja": "え、でも、私……。", "zh": "咦，可是，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "63f7a045e294a179d09d544526ba65c7816ed881a4422e5f264f75688b093820", "ja": "素直に気持ちを表現できるのは、エミリーちゃんの\n良いところですよ～？　忘れないように～。", "zh": "能够坦率地表达自己的心情，是艾米莉的优点哦～？可别忘了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f98dc441134b6aa7f7de324d9f8b648d135dd372e5116c69f0b8247610283674", "ja": "そうですよ。エミリーさんの好きという気持ちが、\nこのお仕事にも繋がったのだと思いますし。", "zh": "是啊。我觉得，艾米莉喜欢它的这份心情，也促成了这次工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b6eedffb20a1f366d851da77bccdd9d165fc9584cc1e8848e00f94dc72cd9b21", "ja": "それに見てくださる方も、きっとこのドラマが大好きな\n人に紹介してもらったほうが、嬉しいと思いますから。", "zh": "而且，我想，前来看这部电视剧的人，如果是由真正喜欢这部剧的人介绍来的，\n也一定会更开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "7375d8de91b7cc7d2e043b33d6967c02a1b20ab6208594a9ac38acb25c81274c", "ja": "朋花さん、紬さん……。\nありがとうございます！　ホッとしました……♪", "zh": "朋花、紬……。\n谢谢你们！我松了口气……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "d0d11c42a6cfb26ad66efb75ff16637916e28224da2d16c7875f12dfcd29a793", "ja": "ふふ。この後も、エミリーちゃんの気持ちのこもった\n解説、楽しみにしていますね～。", "zh": "呵呵。接下来我也很期待听到艾米莉充满心意的解说哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "06ce51e586d70f81c0cf4fb56723f9f7d5d23c674e3c4f45fc76f00c8b927f88", "ja": "フォローは私たちがいたしますので。\nエミリーさんは心のまま、振る舞ってください。", "zh": "后续由我们来配合。  \n艾米莉小姐，请按照自己的心意行动吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "68923333244f7906e45af33e5d076ba81bddeb17d4f83fcf0cf71fe14d9575a4", "ja": "心のままに……あ、あの、では早速！\nひとつ提案があるのですが……構いませんか？", "zh": "随心而动……啊、那个，那我就马上开始了！\n我有一个提议……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "80019e24a2f76b71d7e440a381ee434b0f075ab871adb69561f0544d80655f82", "ja": "えっ、もうアイディアが……？\nもちろん、聞かせてください。", "zh": "咦，已经有想法了……？\n当然，请说给我听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1028_032emi", "source_sha256": "9bb528351c9762f9eca48106e32dddc5876a0586d8b1536bf29ca6e2cadb0f5a", "ja": "えへへ……♪　実は朝から、おふたりと\nやってみたいと思っていたことがあって……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪其实从早上开始，我就有件想和两位一起尝试的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "f152ffa725219820d5f660acf3f6fa725c5a490f26ad31c4d9cdf0db2661ff76", "ja": "私たちで、忍術をご披露するというのは、\nいかがでしょうか？　喜んでもらえると思うのですが。", "zh": "我们来表演一段忍术，您觉得怎么样？我想大家应该会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "0f738f2e492623ae53e3e3fcfb5104d38a18a45525dd2720f2cb401e99bc67dc", "ja": "なるほど～、確かに。以前、お仕事で\n忍術の修行をしたことがありましたからね～。", "zh": "原来如此～确实呢。之前工作的时候，我们曾经修行过忍术呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_020_hs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_020_hs_01_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "729b572d84d21099c84704fbad91d34d4cc6cfd62b816def3ccc58bf3ce13a17", "ja": "そうですね。ならば私は、手裏剣の技を\nお見せしようと思います……ええ、百発百中ですっ。", "zh": "是呢。那么，我就来展示一下手里剑的技巧……嗯，百发百中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
